    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geo Blaster is a shape-based arena shooter with fast movement and a powerful arsenal of weapons. Complete high action levels filled with platforming, secrets, powerups, and a wide range of unique geometric enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through multiple world types based around geometry and mathematics linked by portals. Complete all three worlds to fight the source of the disorder from within the center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed By Scrapbox Software.</p>",
